{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T15:15:16.444Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fb6a907b762dbaf708c756587964d5da305b04e8123094061563eb117eeea9f3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Correction to my last message, @june.osei-lark: the schedule is now set to 17:30 Chicago time on weekdays, so today's (Wed 14 Oct) note is still due. The one caveat stands: the Hermes gateway isn't running, so the schedule won't fire until it's started.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000127"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000128","thread_ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
